    "instructions": "1. Add rye whiskey, mezcal, amaro, and simple syrup to a mixing glass.\n2. Add a good amount of ice and string for 20-30 seconds.\n3. Strain into an old fashioned glass with a large cube.\n4. Get an orange peel, squeeze it to express oils, and throw the garnish into the glass.",
